  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">04 ACT 4_Technical Support to government</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Country portfolio budget - CPB Ghana 2019-2023 Provide technical support, including through South&#x2013;South cooperation, for the national school meals programme, the Ministry of Food and Agriculture, the National Disaster Management Organization, the Food and Drugs Authority and the Ghana Health Service to optimize the nutritional quality of school meals; food security monitoring; the early-warning system; disaster risk reduction and emergency preparedness, food safety and quality and food-based dietary guidelines.</narrative>
  </description>
